  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7f543bd3-f170-49b5-a761-164cc5504693"],
 " has the vertices ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InflatedVertex"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InflatedVertex", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"InflatedVertex", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["v", "TI"], ",", " ", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8290dc4d-4f5d-49b5-9a9a-59269ecf4eeb"],
 ". Over a vertex of the first base the numbering goes on, so no new vertex \
takes an old name."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"5a475c21-c4df-44b0-b40e-bf1726f168df"]
